  "macroRenderedOutput": {},
  "body": {
    "storage": {
      "value": "<ac:layout><ac:layout-section ac:type=\"two_right_sidebar\"><ac:layout-cell><p>This document will help you understand how you can troubleshoot issues pertaining to postgresql replication.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><ul><li><h3>Check if postgresql replication is running</h3><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"code\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"563f691e-2be0-4195-bc3f-4ace33a18c20\"><ac:plain-text-body><![CDATA[ps -ef | grep sender\nps -ef | grep receiver]]></ac:plain-text-body></ac:structured-macro></li><li><h3>Check replication replay on slave</h3><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"code\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"08f596df-c284-4de6-b9f6-f7fbb19a4ba9\"><ac:plain-text-body><![CDATA[select pg_last_xlog_receive_location();\nselect pg_last_xlog_replay_location();]]></ac:plain-text-body></ac:structured-macro></li><li><h3>Restart replication on slave if needed (you do this by restarting postgresql on slave)</h3><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"code\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"3d06e93d-d0e5-4a42-907e-2f47e085dea8\"><ac:plain-text-body><![CDATA[sudo service postgresql-9.2 restart]]></ac:plain-text-body></ac:structured-macro></li></ul></ac:layout-cell><ac:layout-cell><p>&nbsp;</p></ac:layout-cell></ac:layout-section></ac:layout>",
      "representation": "storage",
      "embeddedContent": [],
      "_expandable": {
        "content": "/rest/api/content/20643953"
      }
    },
    "view": {
      "value": "<div class=\"contentLayout2\">\n<div class=\"columnLayout two-right-sidebar\" data-layout=\"two-right-sidebar\">\n<div class=\"cell normal\" data-type=\"normal\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<p>This document will help you understand how you can troubleshoot issues pertaining to postgresql replication.</p><p> </p><ul><li><h3 id=\"Troubleshootingpostgresqlreplicationissues-Checkifpostgresqlreplicationisrunning\">Check if postgresql replication is running</h3><div class=\"code panel pdl conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"563f691e-2be0-4195-bc3f-4ace33a18c20\" data-macro-name=\"code\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent pdl\">\n<pre class=\"syntaxhighlighter-pre\" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=\"brush: bash; gutter: false; theme: Confluence\" data-theme=\"Confluence\">ps -ef | grep sender\nps -ef | grep receiver</pre>\n</div></div></li><li><h3 id=\"Troubleshootingpostgresqlreplicationissues-Checkreplicationreplayonslave\">Check replication replay on slave</h3><div class=\"code panel pdl conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"08f596df-c284-4de6-b9f6-f7fbb19a4ba9\" data-macro-name=\"code\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent pdl\">\n<pre class=\"syntaxhighlighter-pre\" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=\"brush: bash; gutter: false; theme: Confluence\" data-theme=\"Confluence\">select pg_last_xlog_receive_location();\nselect pg_last_xlog_replay_location();</pre>\n</div></div></li><li><h3 id=\"Troubleshootingpostgresqlreplicationissues-Restartreplicationonslaveifneeded(youdothisbyrestartingpostgresqlonslave)\">Restart replication on slave if needed (you do this by restarting postgresql on slave)</h3><div class=\"code panel pdl conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"3d06e93d-d0e5-4a42-907e-2f47e085dea8\" data-macro-name=\"code\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent pdl\">\n<pre class=\"syntaxhighlighter-pre\" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=\"brush: bash; gutter: false; theme: Confluence\" data-theme=\"Confluence\">sudo service postgresql-9.2 restart</pre>\n</div></div></li></ul></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"cell aside\" data-type=\"aside\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<p> </p></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
